%% External LLM
GeminiFlash((Gemini 2.5 Flash))
GeminiPro((Gemini 2.5 Pro))

%% Routing - The Live Retell Path
UserVoice -->|Audio| Retell
Retell -->|JSON WebSocket| Ngrok
Ngrok -->|JSON WebSocket| WS_Endpoint

%% Routing - The TA Simulator Path
TA -->|Clicks/Text| Simulator
Simulator -->|JSON WebSocket| WS_Endpoint

%% Routing - The Kitchen Path
Kitchen -->|Approve/Deny| Tablet
Tablet -->|JSON POST| Webhook_Endpoint

%% Internal Data Flow
WS_Endpoint -->|Extract call_id| Logger
Logger --> Sys1

Sys1 -->|Check| Cache
Sys1 <-->|Read| Menu
Sys1 <-->|Prompt| GeminiFlash

Sys1 -->|Audio Transcript & Barge-in Flag| Sys2
Sys2 <-->|Prompt| GeminiPro
Sys2 -->|JSON State Update| State

Webhook_Endpoint -->|Status Update| State
State -.->|Updated Context| Sys1

Sys1 -->|Text to Speak| WS_Endpoint


